{
  "id": 183949654,
  "iid": 8579,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "SAPRouter: Added SAP Router as main dissector",
  "description": "Added the SAP Router dissector protocol from [SecureAuth's plugin](https://github.com/SecureAuthCorp/SAP-Dissection-plug-in-for-Wireshark/blob/master/src/packet-saprouter.c).\n\nThis is a dissector that implements the Router protocol. When router traffic is found, it creates a conversartion and uses the respective port being routed to call the corresponding registered dissector. Dissection of SNC protected traffic is disabled/commented as it requires the SNC dissector enabled.\n\nSome details and example requests can be found in [pysap's documentation](https://pysap.readthedocs.io/en/latest/protocols/SAPRouter.html).",
  "state": "merged",
