      ],
      "title": "SAPRouter: Added SAP Router as main dissector",
      "message": "SAPRouter: Added SAP Router as main dissector\n\nAdded the SAP Router dissector protocol from [SecureAuth's plugin](https://github.com/SecureAuthCorp/SAP-Dissection-plug-in-for-Wireshark/blob/master/src/packet-saprouter.c).\n\nThis is a dissector that implements the Router protocol. When router traffic is found, it creates a conversartion and uses the respective port being routed to call the corresponding registered dissector. Dissection of SNC protected traffic is disabled/commented as it requires the SNC dissector enabled.\n\nSome details and example requests can be found in [pysap's documentation](https://pysap.readthedocs.io/en/latest/protocols/SAPRouter.html).\n",
      "author_name": "Martin Gallo",
      "author_email": "martin.gallo@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-09-29T11:22:25.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Alexis La Goutte",
      "committer_email": "alexis.lagoutte@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2022-11-21T14:45:21.000+00:00",
